OL,3,GNEWSAMoney offered by SoS does not go
OL,4,Afar enough, parties say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollowing the passing of a deadline in
OL,7,FAugust, Stormont officials were given
OL,8,Flegal powers to spend up to 95% of last
OL,9,Fyear's funding in the absence of
OL,10,Fministers agreeing the budget.
